  "readings": [
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "從弟玄謨子瞻，宋明帝世為黃門郎，素輕世祖。",
      "reading": "玄謨子瞻於宋明帝世任黃門郎。原句以玄謨為玄載從弟，與南史族序相反。",
      "note": "玄謨子瞻於宋明帝世任黃門郎。原句以玄謨為玄載從弟，與南史族序相反。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "世祖時在大床寢，瞻謂豫章王曰：「帳中物亦復隨人寢興。」",
      "reading": "齊武帝當時尚未即位；瞻告豫章王嶷，譏床上之人。",
      "note": "齊武帝當時尚未即位；瞻告豫章王嶷，譏床上之人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 48,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-48",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "世祖銜之，未嘗形色。",
      "reading": "世祖蕭賾懷怨。",
      "note": "世祖蕭賾懷怨。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 48,
      "end_codepoint": 58,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-58",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "建元元年，為冠軍將軍、永嘉太守，詣闕跪拜不如儀，為守寺所列。",
      "reading": "建元元年479任冠軍、永嘉，因跪拜儀節受劾。",
      "note": "建元元年479任冠軍、永嘉，因跪拜儀節受劾。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 58,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "有司以啟世祖，世祖召瞻入東宮，仍送付廷尉殺之。",
      "reading": "蕭賾在東宮召王瞻，送廷尉殺之。",
      "note": "蕭賾在東宮召王瞻，送廷尉殺之。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 111,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-111",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "遣左右口啟上曰：「父辱子死，王瞻傲慢朝廷，臣輒以收治。」",
      "reading": "蕭賾向高帝自言父辱子死，臣指蕭賾。",
      "note": "蕭賾向高帝自言父辱子死，臣指蕭賾。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 111,
      "end_codepoint": 139,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-139",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "太祖曰：「語郎，此何足計！」",
      "reading": "太祖道成初以為不必計。",
      "note": "太祖道成初以為不必計。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 139,
      "end_codepoint": 153,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-153",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "旣聞瞻已死，乃默無言。",
      "reading": "既知已死而默。",
      "note": "既知已死而默。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 153,
      "end_codepoint": 164,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "瞻兄寬，宋世與瞻竝為方伯，至是瞻雖坐事，而寬位待如舊也。",
      "reading": "寬長於瞻，亦為方伯；瞻獲罪無損寬位。",
      "note": "寬長於瞻，亦為方伯；瞻獲罪無損寬位。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 28,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-28",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "寬泰始初為隨郡，值西方反，父玄謨在都，寬棄郡歸，明帝加賞，使隨張永討薛安都。",
      "reading": "宋泰始初寬為隨郡，父在都，棄郡東歸；明帝令隨張永討薛安都。",
      "note": "宋泰始初寬為隨郡，父在都，棄郡東歸；明帝令隨張永討薛安都。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 28,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-66",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "寬辭以母猶存，在西為賊所執，請得西行。",
      "reading": "寬以母親仍在西方被執而辭，請西行。",
      "note": "寬以母親仍在西方被執而辭，請西行。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 66,
      "end_codepoint": 85,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-85",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "遂襲破隨郡，斬偽太守劉師念，拔其母。",
      "reading": "襲破隨郡、斬劉師念、救母；太守之「偽」是史書立場。",
      "note": "襲破隨郡、斬劉師念、救母；太守之「偽」是史書立場。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 85,
      "end_codepoint": 103,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
