      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "事平，明帝嘉之，使圖畫寬形。",
      "reading": "明帝嘉之，令圖形。",
      "note": "明帝嘉之，令圖形。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 103,
      "end_codepoint": 117,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-117",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "建元初，為散騎常侍、光祿大夫，領前軍將軍。",
      "reading": "建元初歷散騎、光祿並領前軍。",
      "note": "建元初歷散騎、光祿並領前軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 117,
      "end_codepoint": 138,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-138",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "永明元年，為太常。",
      "reading": "永明元年483任太常。",
      "note": "永明元年483任太常。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 138,
      "end_codepoint": 147,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-147",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "坐於宅殺牛，免官。",
      "reading": "宅中殺牛坐免。",
      "note": "宅中殺牛坐免。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 147,
      "end_codepoint": 156,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-156",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "後為光祿大夫。",
      "reading": "後復任光祿。",
      "note": "後復任光祿。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 156,
      "end_codepoint": 163,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-163",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "三年，卒。",
      "reading": "承齊永明，三年485卒。",
      "note": "承齊永明，三年485卒。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 163,
      "end_codepoint": 168,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "深弟寬，泰始初，爲隨郡太守。",
      "reading": "深之弟寬，宋泰始初任隨郡太守。",
      "note": "深之弟寬，宋泰始初任隨郡太守。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 14,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "逢四方反，父玄謨在建鄴，寬棄郡自歸。",
      "reading": "王玄謨在建鄴，寬離郡自歸。",
      "note": "王玄謨在建鄴，寬離郡自歸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 14,
      "end_codepoint": 32,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-32",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "以母在西，爲賊所執，請西行，遂襲破隨郡，收其母。",
      "reading": "寬返西救被執之母。",
      "note": "寬返西救被執之母。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 32,
      "end_codepoint": 56,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-56",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "事平，明帝嘉之，使圖寬形以上。",
      "reading": "宋明帝嘉之，令上圖。",
      "note": "宋明帝嘉之，令上圖。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 56,
      "end_codepoint": 71,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-71",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "齊永明元年，爲太常，坐于宅殺牛，免官。",
      "reading": "齊永明元年483為太常，因殺牛免官。",
      "note": "齊永明元年483為太常，因殺牛免官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 71,
      "end_codepoint": 90,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-90",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_B",
      "source_quote": "後卒于光祿大夫。",
      "reading": "後卒於光祿大夫。齊書補永明三年。",
      "note": "後卒於光祿大夫。齊書補永明三年。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangkuan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 90,
      "end_codepoint": 98,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "寬弟瞻字明遠，一字叔鸞。",
      "reading": "寬弟瞻字明遠，另字叔鸞。",
      "note": "寬弟瞻字明遠，另字叔鸞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 12,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-12",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "負氣傲俗，好貶裁人物。",
      "reading": "負氣，好品評人物。",
      "note": "負氣，好品評人物。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 12,
      "end_codepoint": 23,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-23",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "仕宋爲王府參軍。",
      "reading": "宋仕王府參軍。",
      "note": "宋仕王府參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 23,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-31",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "嘗詣劉彦節，直登榻曰：「君侯是公孫，僕是公子，引滿促膝，唯餘二人。」",
      "reading": "在劉彥節席上，君侯指劉秉，僕指瞻。",
      "note": "在劉彥節席上，君侯指劉秉，僕指瞻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 65,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-65",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "彦節外跡雖酬之，意甚不悅。",
      "reading": "劉秉外應而心中不悅。",
      "note": "劉秉外應而心中不悅。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 65,
      "end_codepoint": 78,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-78",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "齊豫章王嶷少時，早與瞻友。",
      "reading": "早與齊豫章王蕭嶷交友。",
      "note": "早與齊豫章王蕭嶷交友。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 78,
      "end_codepoint": 91,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-91",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "瞻常候嶷髙論，齊武帝時在大床寢，瞻謂嶷曰：「帳中人物亦復隨人寢興。」",
      "reading": "往訪嶷時武帝蕭賾在床，瞻語嶷以帳中人。",
      "note": "往訪嶷時武帝蕭賾在床，瞻語嶷以帳中人。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 91,
      "end_codepoint": 125,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-125",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "嶷言次忽問王景文兄楷賢愚何如殷道矜，瞻曰：「卿遂復言他人兄邪。」",
      "reading": "嶷問王景文之兄楷和殷道矜。瞻以卿稱嶷。",
      "note": "嶷問王景文之兄楷和殷道矜。瞻以卿稱嶷。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 125,
      "end_codepoint": 157,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-157",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "武帝笑稱嶷小名阿玉，「汝兄愚，那得忽來王參軍此句」。",
      "reading": "武帝喊嶷小名阿玉；汝兄是說話者蕭賾自指，王參軍指瞻。",
      "note": "武帝喊嶷小名阿玉；汝兄是說話者蕭賾自指，王參軍指瞻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 157,
      "end_codepoint": 183,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-183",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "瞻曰：「直恐如卿來談。」",
      "reading": "瞻對蕭賾答。",
      "note": "瞻對蕭賾答。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 183,
      "end_codepoint": 195,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-195",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "武帝銜之，未嘗形色。",
      "reading": "武帝心怨而未形色。",
      "note": "武帝心怨而未形色。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 195,
      "end_codepoint": 205,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence1-205",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "後暦黃門侍郎。",
      "reading": "後歷黃門侍郎。",
      "note": "後歷黃門侍郎。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 205,
      "end_codepoint": 212,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "及齊建元初，瞻爲永嘉太守，詣闕跪拜不如儀。",
      "reading": "齊建元初任永嘉，入闕跪拜失儀。",
      "note": "齊建元初任永嘉，入闕跪拜失儀。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence2-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "武帝知之，召入東宮，仍送付廷尉殺之。",
      "reading": "蕭賾召於東宮，令廷尉殺瞻。",
      "note": "蕭賾召於東宮，令廷尉殺瞻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 39,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence2-39",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "命左右啓髙帝曰：「父辱子死；王瞻傲朝廷，臣輒已收之。」",
      "reading": "向父高帝啟報，自稱臣。",
      "note": "向父高帝啟報，自稱臣。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 39,
      "end_codepoint": 66,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence2-66",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "髙帝曰：「此何足計。」",
      "reading": "齊高帝初以為不足計。",
      "note": "齊高帝初以為不足計。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 66,
      "end_codepoint": 77,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:received_sentence2-77",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "31b_fd1_f77_C",
      "source_quote": "及聞瞻已死，乃默無言。",
      "reading": "聞瞻已死乃默。",
      "note": "聞瞻已死乃默。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-nanshi-016-wangzhan-xuanmo:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 77,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
